<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">COME ON</font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Come on!</font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">owareru youni</font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Running like a fugitive,</font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">isoi de iru</font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">being chased by something.</font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kawai ta mune ga</font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Inside my heart is pounding,</font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kari tateru no sa</font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">my throat dry like it's withering.</font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no tame de naku</font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">For no single one,</font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no mono de naku</font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">to none does belong,</font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">ore tachi no ima ga</font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">this time is ours, right now...</font></b></font></font>

19
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">itami hodoki kokoro hodoki kage o hodoki</font></b></font></font>

20
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Unraveling the pain, unraveling our hearts, unraveling shadows.</font></b></font></font>

21
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is quite some fog.
I can't see ahead.</font>

32
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bridge should be visible soon.</font>

33
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we reach the side of the bridge,
we'll be in the Land of the Waves.</font>

34
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!
It's huge!</font>

35
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!
Please keep it down.</font>

36
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I took this boat out under cover of fog.</font>

37
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I cut the engine
and am rowing by hand.</font>

38
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they find us,
we'll be in deep trouble.</font>

39
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna-san.</font>

40
00:02:55,690 --> 00:03:00,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to ask you something
before we arrive at the pier.</font>

41
00:03:04,530 --> 00:03:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The identity of your assailants,
and the reason why they are after you.</font>

42
00:03:09,580 --> 00:03:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't tell us...</font>

43
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">our mission may end
when you make landfall.</font>

44
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:25,720
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Assassin</font>

45
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:25,720
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of the Mist!</font>

46
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears I have no choice
but to tell you.</font>

47
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Frankly, I'd like you to listen.</font>

48
00:03:45,370 --> 00:03:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as you said,</font>

49
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this may be beyond
the scope of your mission.</font>

50
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I am being targeted
by a terrifying man.</font>

51
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A terrifying man?</font>

52
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who?</font>

53
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys have probably heard at
least his name before.</font>

54
00:04:09,020 --> 00:04:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A shipping magnate
by the name of Gato.</font>

55
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Gato... of the Gato Company?</font>

56
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of the world's richest men?</font>

57
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who? What?</font>

58
00:04:25,030 --> 00:04:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

59
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the surface, he's the chief executive
of a shipping company...</font>

60
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But underneath,
he is into drug-trafficking</font>

61
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and deals in contraband
using gangs and Shinobi.</font>

62
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, he runs a despicable business,</font>

63
00:04:39,590 --> 00:04:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ruthlessly taking over nations
and enterprises.</font>

64
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was about one year ago...</font>

65
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when that man first set his eyes on
the Land of the Waves...</font>

66
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He used his wealth and violence
to enter this country,</font>

67
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and before anyone knew it,</font>

68
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he had taken complete control of the island's
maritime transportation and shipping.</font>

69
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having a tight grip on the ocean, in an
island nation like the Land of the Waves,</font>

70
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">means having control of finance,
the government, the people... everything.</font>

71
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one thing Gato fears...</font>

72
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the completion of the bridge...</font>

73
00:05:24,590 --> 00:05:26,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has been under construction
for some time now.</font>

74
00:05:30,050 --> 00:05:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

75
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:34,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you're the one building the bridge,
you've become a hindrance.</font>

76
00:05:35,810 --> 00:05:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, those Ninja from before
were Gato's men...?</font>

77
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I don't understand.</font>

78
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is a dangerous one,
who will even use Shinobi.</font>

79
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:51,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you hide that fact from us
when you made your request?</font>

80
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of the Waves...</font>

81
00:05:55,250 --> 00:06:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is a very poor nation,
and even feudal lords have no money.</font>

82
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, we ordinary citizens
have no money either.</font>

83
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We cannot afford to make requests of
Rank B or higher...</font>

84
00:06:11,890 --> 00:06:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, if you pull out
of the mission when I land ashore,</font>

85
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:19,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will, no doubt, be killed.</font>

86
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Killed sometime before I make it home.</font>

87
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's no need for concern!</font>

88
00:06:26,690 --> 00:06:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I die, my cute grandchild
who will turn eight...</font>

89
00:06:30,820 --> 00:06:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will only cry his heart out!</font>

90
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:35,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

91
00:06:36,410 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... my daughter will only blame
the Hidden Leaves Ninja</font>

92
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the rest of her life
and grieve in solitude!</font>

93
00:06:48,010 --> 00:06:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's not your fault at all!</font>

94
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

95
00:06:57,890 --> 00:06:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess we have no choice.</font>

96
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's continue as his bodyguards.</font>

97
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! I am most grateful!</font>

98
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won!</font>

99
00:07:11,450 --> 00:07:12,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be arriving soon.</font>

100
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:20,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna.</font>

101
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears we haven't been noticed
up until this point...</font>

102
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks.</font>

103
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as I go.</font>

104
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you around.</font>

105
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:11,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. You've been a big help.</font>

106
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful.</font>

107
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

108
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get me home safely.</font>

109
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

110
00:08:31,990 --> 00:08:37,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When they next attack,
it won't be Chunin, but elite level Jonin.</font>

111
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break!</font>

112
00:08:51,590 --> 00:08:54,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let this guy do
all the fun stuff anymore!</font>

113
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

114
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... Just a mouse.</font>

115
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit trying to show off!</font>

116
00:09:18,990 --> 00:09:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was nothing there
in the first place!</font>

117
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, Naruto.</font>

118
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't use Kunai Knives recklessly.</font>

119
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're really dangerous.</font>

120
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey brat!
Don't be doing anything confusing!</font>

121
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? I sense a presence there!</font>

122
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, over here?!</font>

123
00:09:37,430 --> 00:09:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

124
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, already!</font>

125
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Someone's really been targeting us
the whole time!</font>

126
00:09:49,230 --> 00:09:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah right!</font>

127
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off, you!</font>

128
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!
What have you done?!</font>

129
00:10:00,410 --> 00:10:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a bunny!</font>

130
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

131
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:08,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't mean to...
I'm sorry, bunny.</font>

132
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just a rabbit, eh.</font>

133
00:10:12,090 --> 00:10:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a snow rabbit.</font>

134
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that doesn't explain
its fur color...</font>

135
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The coat turns white only during winter
when there is little sunlight.</font>

136
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means...</font>

137
00:10:34,190 --> 00:10:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that snow rabbit was raised indoors
without sunlight to be used as a substitution.</font>

138
00:10:48,660 --> 00:10:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guess they're already here...</font>

139
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

140
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... The Demon Brothers wouldn't
be enough to take on these guys.</font>

141
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Copy Ninja from the
Village of the Hidden Leaves.</font>

142
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Sharingan" Kakashi is with them...</font>

143
00:11:10,270 --> 00:11:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, get down!</font>

144
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I'm not mistaken, he's...</font>

145
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

146
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go, here we go,
here we go!</font>

147
00:11:41,930 --> 00:11:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do it this time.</font>

148
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to Sasuke!</font>

149
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well.</font>

150
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:53,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it isn't the Rogue Ninja
of the Hidden Mist, Momochi Zabuza!</font>

151
00:11:53,850 --> 00:11:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rogue Ninja? Whatever.
What's important now is...</font>

152
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready...</font>

153
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

154
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:03,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in the way.</font>

155
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get back, you guys.</font>

156
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

157
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's on a totally different level from
the guys from the other day.</font>

158
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His being our opponent means...</font>

159
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

160
00:12:17,170 --> 00:12:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

161
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that things might be tricky
as I am now.</font>

162
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I assume you are Kakashi,
the Sharingan user...</font>

163
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but...</font>

164
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you hand over the old man.</font>

165
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Huh? Sharingan?
What's that?</font>

166
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What is he talking about?</font>

167
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this guy strong?</font>

168
00:12:58,500 --> 00:12:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan...</font>

169
00:13:00,090 --> 00:13:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get in Manji battle formation, you guys.</font>

170
00:13:03,010 --> 00:13:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protect Tazuna-san...</font>

171
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't involve yourselves in the fight.</font>

172
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

173
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the teamwork
in this situation.</font>

174
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

175
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight me.</font>

176
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this eye...?</font>

177
00:13:27,870 --> 00:13:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well now...</font>

178
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never expected to see
the rumored Sharingan this soon...</font>

179
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an honor.</font>

180
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's been saying Sharingan...</font>

181
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!</font>

182
00:13:39,170 --> 00:13:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...Sharingan.</font>

183
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power that the light of the eye generates,
and the pupil emanates.</font>

184
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The user of
the so-called Visual Jutsu (Art)</font>

185
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is said to possess the vision to see through
all Genjutsu (Illusionary Art),</font>

186
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#000000"><font face="YaFont"><b>Genjutsu</b></font></font></b></font>

187
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#000000"><font face="YaFont"><b>Taijutsu</b></font></font></b></font>

188
00:13:50,350 --> 00:13:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#000000"><font face="YaFont"><b>Ninjutsu<b></b></b></font></font></b></font>

189
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taijutsu (Physical Art),
and Ninjutsu (Ninja Art),</font>

190
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:55,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is able to deflect them.</font>

191
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan is a type of eye
that is unique</font>

192
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the user of the Visual Art.</font>

193
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, that is not the only power of
the Sharingan.</font>

194
00:14:13,290 --> 00:14:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well said.</font>

195
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is not all.</font>

196
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:20,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's more frightening is that
such an eye</font>

197
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can assess an opponent's techniques
and copy them.</font>

198
00:14:31,890 --> 00:14:34,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I was in the ANBU Black Ops
of the Hidden Mist,</font>

199
00:14:34,890 --> 00:14:37,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">search information
about you was in the Bingo Book</font>

200
00:14:37,350 --> 00:14:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would carry around with me.</font>

201
00:14:41,230 --> 00:14:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was also something
else in the book...</font>

202
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About the man who has copied
over one thousand skills...</font>

203
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi the Copy Ninja.</font>

204
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Kakashi-sensei
is that incredible a Ninja?</font>

205
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow!</font>

206
00:15:04,750 --> 00:15:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does this mean?</font>

207
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:09,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan... is a special trait</font>

208
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that appears in only a select few
even among the Uchiha clan.</font>

209
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:15,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be, that this guy...</font>

210
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's end the talking here.</font>

211
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must kill that old man immediately.</font>

212
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, Kakashi, it seems
I have to defeat you first.</font>

213
00:15:49,670 --> 00:15:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

214
00:15:50,590 --> 00:15:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he's even on the water?</font>

215
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's building up quite a bit of Chakra!</font>

216
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Hidden Mist Jutsu.</font>

217
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's vanished?!</font>

218
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

219
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll probably come to erase me first...</font>

220
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is he?</font>

221
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Momochi Zabuza.</font>

222
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an ANBU Black Ops member
in the Hidden Mist and</font>

223
00:16:38,850 --> 00:16:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is known as "the silent killing"
technique expert.</font>

224
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Silen...?</font>

225
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the name suggests...</font>

226
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a killing skill that's implemented
in an instant in silence.</font>

227
00:16:57,950 --> 00:16:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the time you realize it,</font>

228
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's possible you may find yourself
in the afterlife.</font>

229
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't totally mastered
the use of my Sharingan.</font>

230
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So don't lower your guard, you guys.</font>

231
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, if we fail, we'll only die.</font>

232
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you be so carefree?!</font>

233
00:17:23,850 --> 00:17:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mist is steadily getting thicker!</font>

234
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of the Waves
is surrounded by ocean.</font>

235
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So mist rises very easily.</font>

236
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

237
00:17:46,210 --> 00:17:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight spots.</font>

238
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What?</font>

239
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The larynx, the spine,
the lungs, the liver...</font>

240
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The jugular and the subclavian veins.</font>

241
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The kidneys, the heart.</font>

242
00:18:00,470 --> 00:18:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, which vulnerable spot
would be good?</font>

243
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an intense thirst for blood!</font>

244
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I take even one breath,
or move my eyes,</font>

245
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be marked and killed -
that's what I'm feeling.</font>

246
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I'm stuck like this for an hour,
I'll go mad!</font>

247
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Facing a Jonin's intent to kill...</font>

248
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This sensation is like having
my life being held in limbo...</font>

249
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! I'd rather die
to escape this feeling!</font>

250
00:19:01,910 --> 00:19:02,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke.</font>

251
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:07,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.
I'll protect you with my life.</font>

252
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:14,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not allow
my comrades to get killed.</font>

253
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder about that...</font>

254
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

255
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!
Behind you!</font>

256
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

257
00:20:19,690 --> 00:20:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Water Clone Jutsu?</font>

258
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

259
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this mist...</font>

260
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">did he actually copy me?</font>

261
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move.</font>

262
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

263
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

264
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

265
00:21:40,290 --> 00:21:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

266
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

267
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

268
00:21:53,890 --> 00:21:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

269
00:21:57,230 --> 00:22:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

270
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

271
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

272
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:10,820 --> 00:22:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:14,410 --> 00:22:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

275
00:22:27,380 --> 00:22:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

276
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

277
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

278
00:22:37,430 --> 00:22:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

279
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:44,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

280
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

281
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

282
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">O-Oh no!</font>

283
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even Kakashi-sensei fell under
Zabuza's Jutsu.</font>

284
00:22:57,060 --> 00:22:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I've got to escape.</font>

285
00:22:57,850 --> 00:23:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll get killed, for real.</font>

286
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This pain.</font>

287
00:23:03,270 --> 00:23:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What am I doing?!</font>

288
00:23:06,110 --> 00:23:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'd decided, hadn't I?
Not to run away no matter what happens.</font>

289
00:23:10,950 --> 00:23:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"The Determination Voved to the Pain."</font>

290
00:23:13,740 --> 00:23:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm going to kick butt once again!</font>

